<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>And he who keeps His commandments</l><l>Abides in Him, and He in him.</l><l>And in this we know He abides in us,</l><l>By the Spirit whom He gave to us.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>And we know and have believed</l><l>The love which God has in us.</l><l>God is love, and he who abides in love</l><l>Abides in God and God abides in him.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
